WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Before signaling a turn, check for pedestrians and obstacles. Point one arm in

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:24.000
the intended turning direction and move the other arm as illustrated. Demonstrate left

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:36.000
and right turns separately, and stop if the driver does not understand.

